      "writtenOn": "2026-02-11T08:55:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here is some information, hope this can answer your question. These interfaces can help to export cycle, time, freq at the same time. It can be used in vendor kernel module to get these information to know the offset between start of sched clock time and start of arch timer counter. Say that other subsystem also use arch timer counter as the clock source, the offset can be use to align timestamp between kernel and other subsystems.",
      "parentUuid": "97315fff_f88bce94",
      "revId": "03aeed1fb07163c86457d4e441b7aef97599f1d2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
