      "writtenOn": "2026-02-14T04:00:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, I suspect there is something akin to the get_device_system_crosststamp() that could be used to create a proper interface to align sched_clock with other clockids (accessing the arch timer counter should be akin to CLOCK_MONOTONIC_RAW).\n\nThat said, I\u0027m a bit swamped at the moment, so I\u0027m not sure I have bandwidth to propose and work through an alternative solution with you.\n\nFor future kernels, I think we will be hesitant to export this sort of internal accessor logic, so please do plan to develop an alternative solution.",
